            "notes": "[Launch Vector](item_7d4ef8eb-a008-4f63-802d-a67bd9d6989e) is a ability that is overlooked by a lot of people. This is actually a very good item as it is able to break space **AND** create space for your team. The combo I use with this is:\n\n1. [Concussive Blast](ability_602706dc-ce7f-4f09-878d-08307bf435e1) the backline\n\n2. Attack whoever is the lowest \n\n3. Run away (if needed)",
