            "created_at": "2025-09-24T23:18:00.486723+00:00",
            "notes": "[Overcharged Ordnance](item_f261877b-39e5-4248-aeca-7fe34de8ce10) is just solid. If you are not doing enough damage to their lineup that they don't look up, this is a good choice. Weapon power goes a long way. A big amount of damage in this builds is going to be from your rocket launcher. \n\nThis is really effective in the payload race modes as:\n1. You can knock them off the cart\n2. There is going to be 100% that group that stands together while one person pushes the cart\n3. Basically, clumping = good. If they clump, send [Concussive Blast](ability_602706dc-ce7f-4f09-878d-08307bf435e1).",
