            "notes": "\"Explosions!\" - one great Australian guy\n\nAnyways, [Speed Kills](item_2ee0fb37-d15c-4f4c-bac5-26f04794fee9) is just a way to rotate, take angles, and deal damage. It is very easy to look over the most important thing about this power. [Move Speed](stat_move_speed). Speed is important. With this, you are going to be faster. \n\n[Ability Power](stat_ability_power) is also going to be very useful for, as always, disrupting the opponent. I love the simplicity of this [Launch Vector](item_7d4ef8eb-a008-4f63-802d-a67bd9d6989e) power. You don't need to position yourself with [Jet Dash](ability_42951473-38bc-48a2-ab3b-cc06e573a6cc) to deal damage and still stay alive, unlike the other [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) build. Also because the rockets are launched from the blast, the damage falloff is going to be minimal dealing a chunk of their HP.",
